-- the shape of a recursive field's type (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.18 “E28b — Strict positivity under Π codomains and Σ components”), the machine's ConInfo.rsh: D itself, a path line
-- into one, a function (its domain not mentioning D and not a tick: a later D takes no hypothesis)
-- into one, a pair with recursive components; sh-none when the field is not recursive
data Shape = sh-rec | sh-path s | sh-pi s | sh-fst s | sh-snd s | sh-pair s t | sh-none
